        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="hero-banner">
            <div>
                <div class="hero-title">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt-lightning" style="color: var(--accent);"></i>
                    Syncfusion Essential Studio Enterprise Hub
                </div>
                <div class="hero-subtitle">
                    Licensed EJ2 DataGrid with Virtualization, Column Grouping, Multi-Sorting, and Direct Excel/PDF Ledger Export.
